commit c2a781cea87ff1c01711476f52c48553f0939e3f
Author: ledger <ledger@example.invalid>
Date:   Mon Nov 23 02:00:45 2026 +0000

    Add committee tasks board
    
    Tasks grouped by person (nobody's-name first, sorted by due date, overdue and
    due-this-week flagged), done tasks under one fold, and the polytunnel rota from
    the sheet's two side columns shown as its own list at the top. Reads the export
    in incoming/tasks.csv directly so a new export needs no copying step.
    
    Kit: board.json can set "layout": "people" and a "rota"; columns can take
    "date" and "prefix"; status words match case-insensitively ("Done" in the
    export). Events board output unchanged apart from the added CSS.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

